ant to see your health care provider and find out why it happened start here syncope fainting national institute of neurological disorders and stroke symptoms vasovagal syncope symptoms and causes mayo foundation for medical education and research also in spanish diagnosis and tests tilt table test mayo foundation for medical education and research also in spanish vasovagal syncope diagnosis and treatment mayo foundation for medical education and research prevention and risk factors common triggers of vasovagal syncope and how to reduce your risk of fainting harvard medical school treatments and therapies fainting first aid mayo foundation for medical education and research also in spanish related issues fainting and vaccines centers for disease control and prevention syncope fainting heart rhythm society specifics fainting during urination micturition syncope what causes it mayo foundation for medical education and research also in spanish clinical trials clinicaltrials gov syncope national institutes of health clinicaltrials gov syncope vasovagal national institutes of health journal articles references and abstracts from medline pubmed national library of medicine article a systematic approach to nontraumatic falls integrating tilt table testing and article carotid sinus hypersensitivity and orthostatic hypotension in unexplained syncope article time dependent diagnostic yield and therapeutic impact of implantable loop recorders brugada fainting see more articles find an expert american heart association national heart lung and blood institute national institute of neurological disorders and stroke upbeat org heart rhythm society children syncope fainting for parents nemours foundation also in spanish what to do about fainting nemours foundation also in spanish teenagers dizziness and fainting in children and teens american academy of pediatrics also in spanish older adults fainting syncope ags health in aging foundation patient handouts fainting medical encyclop